{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9620": "WILLIAM: 你好？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9621": "JEROME: 各位好，我是杰罗姆·雷诺医生，想查清哈特小姐出了什么事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9622": "WILLIAM: 我是威廉·麦克马斯特，这是妻子琳达，还有儿子哈里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9623": "LINDA: 幸会。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9624": "你们什么时候到的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9625": "WILLIAM: 三天前，从高地的家过来可走了不短的一程，我们会住……不，原本打算住两周。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9626": "LINDA: 很久以前，威廉和阿尔弗雷德是同学。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9627": "你们有人见过哈特小姐吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9628": "WILLIAM: 晚餐时见过一面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9629": "WILLIAM: 前天晚上吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9630": "有发现她生病或不安吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9631": "LINDA: 啊，没有，她看起来兴致很好，大家原本没料到她会来吃晚餐，厨师还临时替她准备了一份。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9632": "JEROME: 是叫哈里吧？有什么想补充的吗？这可能关系到一位女士的性命。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9633": "HARRY: 那我还是说吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9634": "LINDA: 哈罗德，那是她的私事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9635": "HARRY: 你也听见了，万一她受伤了呢？医生得知道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9636": "HARRY: 根本没有什么“艾米莉·哈特”，她其实是伊芙琳·哈考特，用了化名出来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9637": "JEROME: 这个名字我不熟悉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9638": "HARRY: 她是喜歌剧的著名歌手，最近首都特别流行这类演出，至少出事之前是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9639": "LINDA: 起初我没认出来，只听过她的名字，没看过她演出。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9640": "HARRY: 我也没看过，只在报纸上见过照片，倒是晚餐时有人跟我讲过看她演出的事，可我忘了是谁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9641": "知道昨晚谁去过她的房间吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9642": "LINDA: 不知道，不过我们就住隔壁，确实听见有人说话。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9643": "WILLIAM: 我都不确定是不是真听到了，也许声音是从别处传来的，让我们听错了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9644": "JEROME: 为什么这么说？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9645": "WILLIAM: 因为我没听见脚步，也没听见她的房门打开，你知道，这种老宅子的门吱呀声可大了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9646": "关于伊芙琳，还有什么能告诉我的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9647": "LINDA: 她确实有些不对劲，我们正聊得好好的，她突然就得走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9648": "LINDA: 她不肯说为什么，不过看着有点恶心想吐。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-McMasters-9649": "没有别的问题，谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9650": "ARMAND: 嗯？有客人来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9651": "JEROME: 你好，我是杰罗姆·雷诺医生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9652": "ARMAND: 一眼就认出您了，不过现在看来，报纸上那张照片有点过时。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9653": "JEROME: 真不敢想他们用的是哪张。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9654": "ARMAND: 我是阿尔芒·马洛里，这是母亲亨丽埃塔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9655": "你们和哈特小姐说过话吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9656": "ARMAND: 啊，没有，我们没机会见到她，她是前天晚上和其他客人一起吃的饭。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9657": "什么时候到的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9658": "HENRIETTA: 昨晚才到，火车晚点了，这阵子常这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9659": "知道哈特小姐就是伊芙琳·哈考特吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9660": "ARMAND: 哦，原来是真的？听到过些风声，可没信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9661": "HENRIETTA: 那没见到她真是可惜，除非她还会回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9662": "HENRIETTA: 真难相信她会出什么事，她那么有名。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9663": "ARMAND: 昨晚她临时取消了，没下来吃饭。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9664": "HENRIETTA: 首都遭灾前，我们还看过她登台，演得可真好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9665": "ARMAND: 我很想认识她，尤其是在这么私密的场合。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9666": "HENRIETTA: 王国里哪个年轻男人不想呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9667": "知道谁去过她的房间吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9668": "ARMAND: 连她住哪间，我都不太清楚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9669": "关于伊芙琳的身体状况，你们知道什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9670": "ARMAND: 我不想妄加猜测。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9671": "HENRIETTA: 她出名不只靠长相，也靠歌喉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9672": "HENRIETTA: 不过我们看那场时，到了第三幕，她已经喘得厉害。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Malories-9673": "就这些，谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9674": "WARREN: 哦？哪位？律师吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9675": "JEROME: 不，我是杰罗姆·雷诺医生，你是？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9676": "WARREN: 沃伦·威格拉姆，幸会。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9677": "你和杰赛亚·威格拉姆有亲缘关系？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9678": "WARREN: 当然，我是他最大的孙辈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9679": "WARREN: 你们这些读书人总打听他，可他早就不在公众面前露面了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9680": "WARREN: 还没糊涂时，他就是出了名的怪脾气老头，后来也没变好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9681": "杰赛亚在哪里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9682": "WARREN: 哦，完全不知道。他年纪那么大，攒下不少房子，这里和首都都有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9683": "WARREN: 哪栋都可能，父亲阿尔弗雷德会更清楚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9684": "你见过哈特小姐吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9685": "WARREN: 谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9686": "JEROME: 没见过？住在楼上后面卧室的那位女士？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9687": "WARREN: 哦，啊，对，也许碰见过。她那种女人，一般没多久就会厌烦我的殷勤。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9688": "哪种女人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9689": "WARREN: 就是那些……怎么说……自己在世上闯出了一番天地的女人。对她们来说，我还不够有野心。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9690": "你知道哈特小姐就是伊芙琳·哈考特吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9691": "WARREN: 知道，她让人过目难忘。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9692": "JEROME: 以前见过？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9693": "WARREN: 可以这么说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9694": "听说你和伊芙琳有过情事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9695": "WARREN: 嗯！伊芙琳的情人名单……总之，可不短。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9696": "WARREN: 反正，我们的关系没持续多久。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9697": "昨晚去过她的房间吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9698": "WARREN: 哈！她才不会给我开门呢。不信，你随便找个认识她的人问问。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9699": "你知道伊芙琳怀孕了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9700": "WARREN: 反正不可能是我的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9701": "JEROME: 你似乎很确定。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9702": "WARREN: 我要是真能有孩子……早就有了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Warren-9703": "那就不问了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9704": "NEVILLE: 你好？有什么事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9705": "JEROME: 我是杰罗姆·雷诺医生，正在查哈特小姐出了什么事。我担心她受了伤。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9706": "你是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9707": "NEVILLE: 内维尔·威格拉姆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9708": "你和杰赛亚·威格拉姆有亲缘关系？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9709": "NEVILLE: 他是我祖父，我们一直很亲近，可惜已经好久没见他了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9710": "见过哈特小姐吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9711": "NEVILLE: 擦身时见过一面，我一天半前才到，是来参加表亲舞会的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9712": "你知道她是伊芙琳·哈考特吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9713": "NEVILLE: 知道，想认不出来都难。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9714": "NEVILLE: 大概算是个公开的秘密吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9715": "昨晚去过伊芙琳的房间吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9716": "NEVILLE: 我为什么要去？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9717": "JEROME: 传闻你们之间有过感情纠葛。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9718": "NEVILLE: 传闻里和她相好的男人可多了……不过，我不会轻信那些话来侮辱她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9719": "JEROME: 我注意到，你并没有否认。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9720": "NEVILLE: 非要知道的话，昨晚我和乔治·斯洛普茅斯在书房待到很晚，有很多旧事要叙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9721": "知道伊芙琳怀孕了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9722": "NEVILLE: 我——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9723": "NEVILLE: 她什么时候来的？谁邀请的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9724": "JEROME: 据我了解，不是你姑母，就是你父亲，不过这点还有些争议。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9725": "NEVILLE: 难怪她住角落那间，他们会把不想让人知道的客人安置在那儿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9726": "JEROME: 为什么是那间？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9727": "NEVILLE: 我有个猜测，不过解释起来太多，我不打算细说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Neville-9728": "没有别的问题，谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-evelynChecker-9729": "KERAUNOS: 伊芙琳调查进度当前为 0。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-evelynChecker-9730": "KERAUNOS: 伊芙琳调查进度当前为 1。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-evelynChecker-9731": "KERAUNOS: 伊芙琳调查进度当前为 2。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-evelynChecker-9732": "KERAUNOS: 伊芙琳调查进度当前为 3。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-evelynChecker-9733": "KERAUNOS: 伊芙琳调查进度当前为 4。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9734": "GEORGE: 哦！你是？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9735": "JEROME: 我是杰罗姆·雷诺医生，正在调查哈特小姐的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9736": "GEORGE: 很讨人喜欢的年轻女士，我也才认识她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9737": "你是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9738": "GEORGE: 乔治·斯洛普茅斯，没错，我外祖父就是那位著名作家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9739": "你是来参加舞会的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9740": "GEORGE: 正是，朱莉娅小姐不仅讨人喜欢，还将继承这座宅邸及附属产业，而她姨母对此可不太痛快。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9741": "GEORGE: 这门婚事能替我解决很多难题，可老实说，她年纪还是太小了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9742": "昨晚你和内维尔在一起？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9743": "GEORGE: 哦，是啊，我们是大学同学，有不少旧事要聊，又有一瓶上好的白兰地助兴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9744": "GEORGE: 所以今天早上，我们俩都很晚才下楼吃早餐。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9745": "你需要朱莉娅的钱？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9746": "GEORGE: 那笔钱确实很有吸引力，斯洛普茅斯家的第三代可没你想的那么阔绰。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9747": "GEORGE: 外祖父留下的财产确实不少，可他有十个孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9748": "GEORGE: 我是他第六个女儿的次子，除了家族的名声和良好的教育，没能分到多少别的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9749": "知道艾米莉·哈特就是伊芙琳·哈考特吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9750": "GEORGE: 不知道，平常介绍给我认识的女士属于……另一个阶层。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9751": "知道伊芙琳怀孕了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9752": "GEORGE: 是吗？她掩饰得很好，确实，一点也看不出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-George-9753": "没有别的问题，谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9754": "ANABEL: 抱歉，你是哪位？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9755": "JEROME: 我是杰罗姆·雷诺医生，想查清哈特小姐出了什么事，好帮她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9756": "FABIEN: 报纸上那位雷诺医生？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9757": "ANABEL: 哦，现在看出来了，是他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9758": "你们是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9759": "ANABEL: 我是安娜贝尔·凡尔纳，这是丈夫法比安，想必你已经见过我母亲凯瑟琳了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9760": "你们见过哈特小姐吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9761": "ANABEL: 路过时见过，我们昨天才到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9762": "FABIEN: 灾难之后，出行慢得不得了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9763": "ANABEL: 后面还有客人要来，真不明白母亲为什么让她住在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9764": "ANABEL: 尤其还是角落那间……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9765": "知道哈特小姐就是伊芙琳·哈考特吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9766": "ANABEL: 见到时就觉得可能是她，可我尽量不去想，那只会让事情更糟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9767": "JEROME: 伊芙琳在这里，为什么会更糟？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9768": "ANABEL: 阿尔弗雷德舅舅的儿子，沃伦和内维尔，都传过和她的情事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9769": "ANABEL: 提起伊芙琳·哈考特，大家议论她的情人，几乎和议论她的演出一样多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9770": "不是你舅舅阿尔弗雷德带她来的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9771": "ANABEL: 这说不通，舅舅自己家里有的是房间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9772": "ANABEL: 母亲一定另有打算。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9773": "FABIEN: 凯瑟琳总有办法把自己卷进新的纠葛。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9774": "角落那间房有什么奇怪的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9775": "ANABEL: 除了招待“秘密”客人，那间房一直空着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9776": "ANABEL: 小时候，连进去玩都不许。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9777": "知道昨晚谁去过伊芙琳房间吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9778": "FABIEN: 哦，不，这又要变成威格拉姆家惯有的一场闹剧了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9779": "ANABEL: 不知道，我不知道谁去过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9780": "ANABEL: 仔细想想，她居然住角落那间，本身就有点奇怪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9781": "ANABEL: 就算客人多，母亲也通常不让人住那儿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9782": "JEROME: 她恐怕不会对我说实话。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9783": "ANABEL: 那是当然，不过你也许能从管家斯托克斯那里问出些什么，至少他不会给你编出一大篇故事来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9784": "你发现伊芙琳有什么异常吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9785": "ANABEL: 异常？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9786": "JEROME: 能看出身体状况的迹象。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9787": "ANABEL: 她动作很慢，身上的幻形术……也很复杂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9788": "JEROME: 她给自己施了幻术？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9789": "ANABEL: 对，我也受过不少魔法训练，出门用幻形术并不少见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9790": "ANABEL: 可只是在屋里屋外走动，就用这么强的？很奇怪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9791": "ANABEL: 她可能想掩饰什么，伤势？发胖？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9792": "伊芙琳有没有可能怀孕了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9793": "ANABEL: 那倒能解释不少事，可解释不了她现在在哪儿，也解释不了是谁让她来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Anabel-9794": "就这些，谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9795": "STOKES: 先生，有何吩咐？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9796": "JEROME: 我是杰罗姆·雷诺医生，想尽量了解那位失踪女子，好帮助她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9797": "STOKES: 好的，先生，不过我不确定能帮上什么忙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9798": "你是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9799": "STOKES: 我是这里的管家，为威格拉姆家服务多年。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9800": "知道杰赛亚·威格拉姆在哪儿吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9801": "STOKES: 我知道他不在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9802": "知道她其实是伊芙琳·哈考特吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9803": "STOKES: 恐怕这两个名字，对我都没什么意义。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9804": "有发现伊芙琳哪里不对劲吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9805": "STOKES: 哈特小姐的事？不该由我评论。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9806": "JEROME: 这关系到一位女士的性命。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9807": "STOKES: 她……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9808": "STOKES: 她穿衣要花很久，却不让我们派人上楼帮忙，洗澡也是这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9809": "知道昨晚谁去过伊芙琳房间吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9810": "STOKES: 不知道，我那时睡了，也没人来要楼上的钥匙，或问她在哪里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9811": "STOKES: 其他仆人我已经问过，似乎只有莉塞特听见了有人来访。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9812": "知道内维尔和沃伦的情事吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9813": "STOKES: 打探威格拉姆家的私生活，不是我的职责。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9814": "为什么让伊芙琳住角落那间房？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9815": "STOKES: 眼下客满。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9816": "JEROME: 可伊芙琳比其他人早到很久。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9817": "STOKES: 打理宅邸自然得事先安排妥当，这些事几周甚至几个月前就定好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9818": "为她做过什么特别准备吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9819": "STOKES: 这真与您的调查有关？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9820": "JEROME: 有关，她怀孕了，凯瑟琳夫人或她兄弟一定有人知情。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9821": "JEROME: 若是高风险妊娠，可能会做些特别准备。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9822": "STOKES: 凯瑟琳夫人只吩咐我把那间房里的古董衣柜解锁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Stokes-9823": "就这些，谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9824": "LISETTE: 哦！抱歉，有什么事吗？不知道又来了位客人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9825": "JEROME: 别担心，我是雷诺医生，想查清哈特小姐出了什么事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9826": "LISETTE: 要是我……凯瑟琳夫人恐怕不会高兴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9827": "JEROME: 我不管警方的事，她也许只是受了伤，我能帮她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9828": "LISETTE: 好吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9829": "哈特小姐什么时候、怎么来的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9830": "LISETTE: 大约一个月前，独自来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9831": "知道哈特小姐就是伊芙琳·哈考特吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9832": "LISETTE: 猜到她是个名人，不过没听过她的名字。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9833": "伊芙琳有什么不寻常的地方吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9834": "LISETTE: 她很挑剔，上等人很多都这样，可她……怎么说……不太一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9835": "LISETTE: 各种气味都让她难受，还有……这个有点私密。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9836": "JEROME: 我是医生，放心，这些事我早听惯了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9837": "LISETTE: 好吧……她总要上厕所。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9838": "最近有人到她房间探望吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9839": "LISETTE: 我确实听见里面还有人，是个男人，声音很低，听不清。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9840": "LISETTE: 不知道是谁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9841": "伊芙琳的房间需要特别准备吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9842": "LISETTE: 啊，嗯……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9843": "LISETTE: 斯托克斯先生把那个旧衣柜的钥匙交给了我，可它平常都是锁着的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9844": "LISETTE: 挺奇怪，因为哈特小姐没带多少衣服。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Lisette-9845": "就这些，谢谢。"
}
